Subject: [PATCH 13/27] MetalSharp: the MetalFX interface is VKD3D-Proton's own
 (ID3D12GraphicsCommandListMetalFX), for this lane's NGX core

---
 include/private/vkd3d_metalfx.h | 66 ++++++++++++++++-----------------
 libs/vkd3d/command.c            | 10 ++---
